# Re-include Unity .meta files (essential for Unity project to work on other machines,
# including Codemagic's Mac builder). The *.meta rule above is for Visual Studio C++
# build artifacts, but it would otherwise catch Unity's per-asset meta files.
!mobile/unity/**/*.meta
!mobile/unity/**/.meta
